# settings_theme_switch.numos — the Settings Theme row must actually switch the
# WHOLE system, not just the screen the picker is drawn on.
#
# Regression target (observed on emulator_pc): picking Casio in Settings
# appeared to do nothing. Two independent faults:
#   (a) SystemApp::update()'s theme guard compared a STALE _pendingTheme against
#       the live id and re-activated the old theme one frame later, so the picker
#       was silently reverted;
#   (b) the launcher latches its topology (grid vs 4x2 MenuList) and colours at
#       MainMenu::create() time and returnToMenu() only calls load(), so even a
#       theme that DID stick left the old launcher on screen.
# This script fails if either comes back.
#
# Run:
#   program --headless --deterministic --script tests/emulator/scripts/settings_theme_switch.numos \
#           --fs-root tests/emulator/fs --frames 1400 --quiet
# Exit codes: 0 ok · 2 parse error · 3 screenshot error · 4 assertion failure.

log "settings_theme_switch: waiting for launcher"
wait 200

assert_app Menu
assert_theme numos

# ── Switch to Casio from the Settings picker ────────────────────────────────
open_app Settings
wait 60
assert_app Settings

# Walk to the Theme row. In this (non-Production) build there is no Brightness
# row, so rows are 0 Angle / 1 Complex / 2 Precision / 3 Steps / 4 Theme.
key down
key down
key down
key down
wait 5
key exe
wait 30

assert_app Settings
assert_theme casio

# Back to the launcher: the theme must have survived the trip and the launcher
# must have been rebuilt for it (a stale grid screen is what (b) looked like).
# The capture is the real proof: assert_theme reads ThemeManager, which was
# always right even when the launcher on screen was not.
key mode
wait 60
assert_app Menu
assert_theme casio
screenshot out/theme_via_settings.ppm

# ── And back again, to prove the picker is not one-way ──────────────────────
open_app Settings
wait 60
key down
key down
key down
key down
wait 5
key exe
wait 30
assert_theme numos

key mode
wait 40
assert_app Menu
assert_theme numos

log "settings_theme_switch: assertions passed"
